                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuba-Juda ndibede mbuli mu-Juda, kuti nkavube ba-Juda, Kulibaabo bali kunsi ku-Mulao ndibede mbubabede, nintali kunsi ku-Mulao ndemwini, kuti nkabavube abo bali kunsi ku-Mulao. ",
          "type": "text",
